Message symbols and option names in the documentation and in the changelog
fragments are now automatically turned into links to the page documenting
them, by a new pre-commit hook. A bare message symbol like :ref:`no-member`
links to the message's page, and an option cited as :ref:`--jobs <jobs-option>`
or :ref:`py-version <py-version-option>` links to its entry in the exhaustive
option list. Current, renamed and deleted messages are all handled, and a name
that no longer exists keeps its literal text.

Refs #10568
